  "operative_text": "Sec. 3 (adding IC 35-47-5-11.5(b)): Except as provided in subsection (c), a person who knowingly or intentionally possesses, manufactures, sells, or delivers armor-piercing ammunition commits a Level 5 felony.\nSec. 3 (adding IC 35-47-5-11.5(a)): As used in this section, \"armor-piercing ammunition\" means:\nSec. 2 (repealing IC 35-47-5-11): IC 35-47-5-11 IS REPEALED [EFFECTIVE JULY 1, 2017]."
}